00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.468
And what you wanna study.

229
00:14:49.177 --> 00:14:51.221
Well. I can just
forward you my transcript.

230
00:14:52.222 --> 00:14:54.224
Or we could have a conversation.

231
00:14:57.394 --> 00:14:59.271
Just sent it to you.

232
00:15:02.858 --> 00:15:04.443
Can't wait to check 'em out.

233
00:15:12.409 --> 00:15:13.577
Really?

234
00:15:14.036 --> 00:15:15.996
Well. then I will be
on my best behavior.

235
00:15:17.706 --> 00:15:19.583
Yeah.
Yeah. she's right here.

236
00:15:20.751 --> 00:15:21.585
Wanna talk to your mom?

237
00:15:21.919 --> 00:15:24.212
Hey. Mom. It's going great.
Love you. Bye.

238
00:15:26.798 --> 00:15:28.133
Uh-huh. yeah.

239
00:15:29.259 --> 00:15:32.429
Okay. We will call you
after the visit tomorrow.

240
00:15:32.846 --> 00:15:33.722
Bye.

241
00:15:34.056 --> 00:15:35.390
What'd she want?

242
00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.768
She wanted to let me know

243
00:15:37.893 --> 00:15:39.353
that the school
we're visiting tomorrow

244
00:15:39.478 --> 00:15:41.480
has a scholarship
offer on the table.

245
00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.358
And to make sure you connect
with the soccer coach.

246
00:15:44.441 --> 00:15:45.359
Yeah.

247
00:15:47.402 --> 00:15:49.154
What's wrong?
Nothing. No.

248
00:15:49.613 --> 00:15:51.239
It's just weird
that she thinks I'd forget

249
00:15:51.323 --> 00:15:52.699
to connect
with the soccer coach.

250
00:15:52.824 --> 00:15:56.620
I don't know. seems like a...
normal motherly reminder to me.

251
00:15:56.703 --> 00:15:57.955
No. it is. it is.

252
00:15:58.789 --> 00:16:00.624
It's just. all she's been
wanting to talk about lately

253
00:16:00.707 --> 00:16:01.500
is soccer.

254
00:16:01.792 --> 00:16:03.752
- Don't you like soccer?
- Yeah. sure.

255
00:16:03.877 --> 00:16:05.003
I mean. I'm happy

256
00:16:05.128 --> 00:16:06.672
about the scholarship offers
we're getting.

257
00:16:06.797 --> 00:16:09.049
Like. I know
it'll help financially. but...

258
00:16:10.968 --> 00:16:11.885
Honestly. I don't even know

259
00:16:11.969 --> 00:16:13.261
if I like playing soccer
that much.

260
00:16:13.804 --> 00:16:15.681
And then playing it in college
is gonna take up

261
00:16:15.806 --> 00:16:19.101
so much of my time. and...
there's other things I...

262
00:16:19.726 --> 00:16:21.561
I don't know. I'm...
I'm into a lot more.

263
00:16:21.645 --> 00:16:22.604
Really?

264
00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.523
Like what?

265
00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:27.317
Art?

266
00:16:29.569 --> 00:16:30.696
What makes you say that?

267
00:16:31.697 --> 00:16:33.407
Well. I did look
at your transcripts.

268
00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:36.618
and I saw that you took
an art elective every semester.

269
00:16:37.411 --> 00:16:39.663
It's way more
than what's required. so...

270
00:16:40.372 --> 00:16:42.082
must mean you really like it.

271
00:16:43.667 --> 00:16:44.668
Yeah. I do.

272
00:16:45.252 --> 00:16:47.045
You wanna tell me more about it?

273
00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:51.675
No. not really.

274
00:16:51.758 --> 00:16:53.635
I don't necessarily
feel like faking

275
00:16:53.719 --> 00:16:55.679
a deep conversation
with you right now.

276
00:16:55.762 --> 00:16:57.264
Alex.
it doesn't have to be

277
00:16:57.389 --> 00:16:58.765
faking a conversation.

278
00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:02.561
If art's what you're into.
I wanna hear all about it.

279
00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.521
No. honestly.
I'm just really exhausted.

280
00:17:04.604 --> 00:17:06.523
I should probably
get some sleep. and...

281
00:17:06.606 --> 00:17:08.567
it's a long day tomorrow.
you know?

282
00:17:22.456 --> 00:17:24.166
- Good night.
- Good night.

283
00:17:41.558 --> 00:17:46.480
One more push!
One more push!

284
00:17:46.938 --> 00:17:49.858
- Go. Go. Yes! Push!
- Breathe. Big push.

285
00:17:49.941 --> 00:17:53.445
Big push. you can do this.

286
00:17:54.446 --> 00:17:56.907
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

287
00:17:59.618 --> 00:18:02.245
My baby! My baby!

288
00:18:06.541 --> 00:18:10.212
That's the fifth one.
Something wrong with the girls.

289
00:18:18.553 --> 00:18:20.013
Bye.
Bye. Alex.

290
00:18:25.685 --> 00:18:28.188
How'd it go?
It was fine. I don't know.

291
00:18:28.313 --> 00:18:30.440
Place seems like
a really big party school.

292
00:18:30.524 --> 00:18:32.109
Yeah. I did see
they have a thing here

293
00:18:32.192 --> 00:18:33.693
called the freshman
underwear run.

294
00:18:33.819 --> 00:18:36.780
Yeah. I don't know.
I'm not really into it.

295
00:18:37.322 --> 00:18:39.199
Well. we got two more
to see. right?

296
00:18:39.658 --> 00:18:40.617
Yeah.

297
00:18:42.536 --> 00:18:43.370
What's wrong?

298
00:18:43.745 --> 00:18:45.205
I just-- I don't know
if I really wanna see

299
00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.832
the other two schools.

300
00:18:47.916 --> 00:18:48.834
Okay.

301
00:18:51.211 --> 00:18:53.547
Can I ask you something?
Yeah.

302
00:18:54.798 --> 00:18:56.049
So. I emailed this school

303
00:18:56.133 --> 00:18:57.300
that I'm interested in
last night.

304
00:18:57.425 --> 00:18:58.593
and they got back to me.

305
00:18:58.677 --> 00:19:01.304
and they said they can
fit me in for a tour tomorrow.

306
00:19:03.056 --> 00:19:04.057
Can you take me?

307
00:19:05.851 --> 00:19:06.977
What school is it?

308
00:19:07.727 --> 00:19:08.979
It's an arts school.

309
00:19:10.063 --> 00:19:11.731
I really wanna try to see

310
00:19:11.815 --> 00:19:13.608
if there's. like.
a future in it for me and...

311
00:19:14.359 --> 00:19:15.152
You know?

312
00:19:15.819 --> 00:19:18.071
But if... if you're not into it.
then obviously. you know...

313
00:19:18.196 --> 00:19:19.656
Well. I'm into it.

314
00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.951
It's. like. a nine-hour drive
the other way though.

315
00:19:24.661 --> 00:19:27.747
I'm retired.
Got nothing but time.

316
00:19:28.582 --> 00:19:29.666
Wait. No.

317
00:19:30.792 --> 00:19:31.668
Are you serious?

318
00:19:32.085 --> 00:19:35.046
Yeah.
Okay. Okay.

319
00:19:37.507 --> 00:19:38.341
Um...

320
00:19:41.511 --> 00:19:43.972
There's just
one other thing. Um...

321
00:19:44.931 --> 00:19:46.308
Can you not tell Mom about it?

322
00:19:46.433 --> 00:19:48.143
I swear I'll tell her
once we get home and... and--

323
00:19:48.268 --> 00:19:51.396
Alex. that's--
I'll say I made you do it.
You know. it's my fault.

324
00:19:52.522 --> 00:19:56.443
Look. she just has this idea
of... of my future in her head.

325
00:19:56.526 --> 00:19:57.861
and that's not me.

326
00:20:01.031 --> 00:20:05.202
Where are we headed?

327
00:20:14.252 --> 00:20:16.588
Okay. Thanks.

328
00:20:17.589 --> 00:20:19.841
No... no vacancy
at that one either.

329
00:20:21.259 --> 00:20:22.761
Well. I'm sure
we'll find something.

330
00:20:22.886 --> 00:20:25.305
Just might be a little farther
from the college.

331
00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.598
That's fine.

332
00:20:27.515 --> 00:20:29.517
♪Doing everything I can... ♪

333
00:20:29.643 --> 00:20:32.229
You know. if worse
comes to worse...

334
00:20:32.312 --> 00:20:33.897
I do have a tent in the back.

335
00:20:34.272 --> 00:20:35.065
Why?

336
00:20:35.815 --> 00:20:41.279
I got a lotta stuff back there.
I'm just saying. if we had to...

337
00:20:42.113 --> 00:20:43.865
we could do
one night of camping.

338
00:20:44.491 --> 00:20:46.451
Camping?
Yeah. like we used to.

339
00:20:46.534 --> 00:20:49.162
Okay. I'm going
to keep looking for a hotel.

340
00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.875
♪Feel the sun
On your face ♪

341
00:20:53.959 --> 00:20:57.337
♪Full of color ♪

342
00:20:57.921 --> 00:21:01.591
♪I'm in bloom... ♪

343
00:21:03.009 --> 00:21:05.345
God.

344
00:21:05.428 --> 00:21:08.265
Okay. I just lost my last bar
so that's that.

345
00:21:08.348 --> 00:21:10.350
Oh. come on.

346
00:21:10.433 --> 00:21:12.894
No service
isn't the end of the world.

347
00:21:15.647 --> 00:21:17.857
Maybe we could even
have a conversation.

348
00:21:19.943 --> 00:21:21.861
Okay.

349
00:21:23.446 --> 00:21:25.448
What do you want
to talk about?

350
00:21:26.992 --> 00:21:29.369
Let's talk about...

351
00:21:29.786 --> 00:21:30.870
why looking at an Art college

352
00:21:30.954 --> 00:21:33.081
has to be a secret
from your mom.

353
00:21:34.165 --> 00:21:36.960
Because according to her.
there's no future or money

354
00:21:37.085 --> 00:21:39.796
in drawing or painting.

355
00:21:40.714 --> 00:21:42.549
She just wants you to be happy.

356
00:21:44.175 --> 00:21:45.593
Maybe...

357
00:21:46.136 --> 00:21:47.637
try being honest with her.

358
00:21:48.972 --> 00:21:51.516
Like you're being honest
about your retirement?

359
00:21:53.018 --> 00:21:53.893
What do you mean?

360
00:21:54.519 --> 00:21:57.355
All you ever talked about
was how much you loved the army.

361
00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:58.523
and how you'd wear the uniform

362
00:21:58.606 --> 00:21:59.899
until they ripped it
off your back.

363
00:21:59.983 --> 00:22:01.735
and now you just expect me
to believe

364
00:22:01.818 --> 00:22:04.446
that you decided to retire?

365
00:22:11.786 --> 00:22:14.039
Okay. Good talk.

366
00:22:36.936 --> 00:22:38.396
I'm gonna go use the bathroom.

367
00:23:00.377 --> 00:23:05.632
♪You took my heart
And bailed away ♪

368
00:23:05.715 --> 00:23:10.845
♪You wanted me
To take your hand ♪

369
00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:15.809
♪I knew that you could
Not be changed... ♪

370
00:23:15.934 --> 00:23:16.893
You like the art?

371
00:23:18.395 --> 00:23:21.314
Yeah. It's cool.

372
00:23:23.441 --> 00:23:24.526
You wanna buy one?

373
00:23:25.568 --> 00:23:29.364
Uh. no. No. thank you.
Do you have a bathroom?

374
00:23:31.241 --> 00:23:35.370
Yeah. Through that side door.
It's real easy to find.

375
00:23:35.954 --> 00:23:36.913
Thank you.

376
00:24:11.573 --> 00:24:14.617
Hey. Hey!

377
00:24:15.452 --> 00:24:17.787
What are you. 16?

378
00:24:19.122 --> 00:24:20.498
Seventeen?

379
00:24:27.338 --> 00:24:28.715
Is that it.
plus the gas?

380
00:24:28.840 --> 00:24:29.716
Yep.

381
00:24:29.799 --> 00:24:30.925
Where you headed?

382
00:24:31.009 --> 00:24:32.594
Well. we're driving
up to Port Winston.

383
00:24:33.136 --> 00:24:35.972
but we were hoping to find
a place to stay near here.

384
00:24:36.222 --> 00:24:37.098
You know of anything?

385
00:24:37.724 --> 00:24:40.226
Nah. there ain't any hotels
between here and Port Winston.

386
00:24:40.351 --> 00:24:41.186
Nothing. huh?

387
00:24:41.311 --> 00:24:42.729
Oh. there's a bunch
of campgrounds

388
00:24:42.854 --> 00:24:43.855
between here and there.

389
00:24:44.564 --> 00:24:47.775
Actually. got a real nice one.
Not too far from here.

390
00:24:48.026 --> 00:24:49.068
How far are we talking?

391
00:24:49.194 --> 00:24:50.820
Just a few miles
up the road.

392
00:24:50.904 --> 00:24:52.447
But it's real easy to miss.

393
00:24:52.530 --> 00:24:53.907
Probably best
if I draw you a map.

394
00:24:54.407 --> 00:24:56.493
Thanks. I'm gonna grab
a couple more things.

395
00:24:56.576 --> 00:24:57.410
Mm-hmm.

396
00:25:09.464 --> 00:25:12.008
There's a small sign
right at the turnoff.

397
00:25:12.091 --> 00:25:14.344
But you wanna go slow
or you're gonna fly right by it.

398
00:25:15.094 --> 00:25:18.640
You wanna make the turn.
and then it's just one mile

399
00:25:18.723 --> 00:25:20.058
from that point.

400
00:25:23.436 --> 00:25:25.146
I got us directions
for a campground.

401
00:25:25.230 --> 00:25:26.105
Okay.

402
00:25:26.189 --> 00:25:27.440
You're gonna love the place.

403
00:25:27.565 --> 00:25:30.151
It's beautiful. and you should
have it all to yourselves.

404
00:25:30.652 --> 00:25:32.820
Hot dogs. chips. water.
Mm-hmm.

405
00:25:33.154 --> 00:25:35.448
Anything else?
No. I'm good. Can we go?

406
00:25:35.532 --> 00:25:36.991
Are you okay?
Yeah. I'm fine.

407
00:25:37.116 --> 00:25:39.327
I just wanna... I just wanna go.

408
00:25:39.702 --> 00:25:40.828
Seventy-eight.

409
00:25:42.580 --> 00:25:45.500
Thanks again.
and keep the change.

410
00:25:45.583 --> 00:25:48.461
Oh. I appreciate that.
You enjoy the peace and quiet.

411
00:25:48.711 --> 00:25:50.505
Take care of each other now.

412
00:26:02.392 --> 00:26:03.268
Call Stanley.

413
00:26:08.523 --> 00:26:12.485
♪Pick me up in your car
Don't care what you're drivin' ♪

414
00:26:12.610 --> 00:26:15.989
♪But it better be the loud
And fancy type... ♪

415
00:26:17.532 --> 00:26:19.450
Feels like
we're getting close.

416
00:26:20.076 --> 00:26:23.454
Says we should see a mile marker
up here on the right.

417
00:26:25.999 --> 00:26:27.417
Is that it?

418
00:26:29.627 --> 00:26:31.963
- There it is.
- There we go.

419
00:26:39.012 --> 00:26:40.972
Is there gonna be a campground?

420
00:26:41.306 --> 00:26:43.391
I mean. it's...

421
00:26:44.267 --> 00:26:45.977
not much of a map. really.

422
00:27:29.979 --> 00:27:31.314
What do you think?

423
00:27:31.397 --> 00:27:34.108
Yeah. it actually
is kinda pretty.

424
00:27:34.484 --> 00:27:35.318
Yeah.

425
00:27:36.027 --> 00:27:38.071
I'm just worried about
not being able to take a shower

426
00:27:38.154 --> 00:27:39.322
before the tour tomorrow.

427
00:27:39.947 --> 00:27:41.699
Bet the lake's not that cold.

428
00:27:41.824 --> 00:27:43.201
Ha-ha.

429
00:27:43.576 --> 00:27:44.619
It's an art school.

430
00:27:45.078 --> 00:27:46.287
I'm sure you won't be
the only person there

431
00:27:46.412 --> 00:27:49.123
who hasn't showered.
Ew. Okay? That's gross.

432
00:27:49.832 --> 00:27:52.043
No. I'm actually kinda
stressing about it. though.

433
00:27:53.753 --> 00:27:54.754
I hear you.

434
00:27:55.672 --> 00:27:57.632
This part of the trip
was not planned.

435
00:27:58.049 --> 00:27:59.759
but here we are.

436
00:27:59.842 --> 00:28:00.677
Yeah.

437
00:28:00.760 --> 00:28:02.428
Let's try to make
the best of it.

438
00:28:02.553 --> 00:28:04.889
I mean. it's gorgeous.

439
00:28:06.057 --> 00:28:08.267
Yeah. You wanna set up camp?

440
00:28:08.685 --> 00:28:10.311
Yeah. Let's do it.
Okay.

441
00:28:36.254 --> 00:28:38.715
I'm impressed you still know
how to set this up.

442
00:28:38.798 --> 00:28:39.632
Of course I do.

443
00:28:40.049 --> 00:28:41.884
Did it. like. 10.000 times
when I was little.

444
00:28:42.385 --> 00:28:43.845
Except now
I'm a lot faster at it.

445
00:28:43.970 --> 00:28:45.179
Yeah. because back then.

446
00:28:45.263 --> 00:28:47.390
you insisted
on doing it yourself...

447
00:28:47.473 --> 00:28:49.016
...and you wouldn't
let me help at all.

448
00:28:49.100 --> 00:28:51.644
Those first couple times.
it took me over an hour

449
00:28:51.728 --> 00:28:53.020
and you were just like...

450
00:28:53.438 --> 00:28:54.856
"You're doing great. sweetie."

451
00:28:54.939 --> 00:28:57.316
